# Desolace - Rares & Treasures companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# An opportunistic sweep for the 5 shipped flagged rares of Desolace and
# its fixed containers. Run it in its own Polestar tab at the end of the
# core route or standalone. EVERY goal is optional: a rare that is not up
# never holds the route. Spawn points and levels are the local Forever
# game data (questie-forever); signature drops are items whose SOLE
# dropper is the rare. The flagged Cursed Centaur is excluded (above-band,
# no sole drop, no quest link — Spiteflayer end of the precedent); the
# in-band Hissperak ships as a kill-note rare (Fingat pattern). No tame
# lines ship (the data has no tameability flag and the core guide carries
# no tame corroboration — see docs/companion-unverified.md). Respawn
# timers are unconfirmed anywhere, so none are stated. No shipped rare is
# a giver, ender, or objective of any core-contracted quest, and none
# drops a core quest item — so this round carries no overlap notes at all.
guide butler-routes-completionist/desolace-rares
title Desolace - Rares & Treasures
levels 30-40
zone Desolace
faction Alliance
category Collectibles
folder Companions
keywords desolace, rares, treasures, companions
coords live
version 1

step Accursed Slitherblade — the north-west

  zone map 1443

  goto 42.17,19.01
  kill 14229 optional
  collect 284713 "Accursed Legguards" optional
  note Level 35 rare at its single confirmed point in the north-west; its sole drop is the Accursed Legguards. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Giggler — the center

  zone map 1443

  goto 61.29,28.91
  kill 14228 optional
  collect 284712 "Hyena Hide Helm" optional
  note Level 34 rare at its single confirmed point in the center; its sole drop is the Hyena Hide Helm. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Hissperak — the center-south

  zone map 1443

  goto 52.86,50.08
  kill 14227 optional
  note Level 37 rare at its single confirmed point in the center-south; the data shows no sole drop for it and it drops no quest item, so there is nothing to collect. No quest takes it.
  note Drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Prince Kellen — the far east

  zone map 1443

  goto 78.93,21.25
  kill 14225 optional
  collect 284717 "Royal Satyr Slicer" optional
  note Level 33 rare at its single confirmed point in the far east; its sole drop is the Royal Satyr Slicer. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

step Kaskk — the far south (band top)

  zone map 1443

  goto 51.15,86.13
  kill 14226 optional
  collect 284708 "Demonstrike Emblem" optional
  note Level 40 rare at its single confirmed point in the far south, sitting exactly at the band top; its sole drop is the Demonstrike Emblem. No quest takes it.
  note Also drops ordinary greens; respawn timer unconfirmed.

