  note Respawn timers unconfirmed.

step Battered Chests — the eastern ruins

  zone map 1443

  loop
  goto 81.00,48.40
  goto 82.40,53.80
  goto 84.50,72.10
  goto 84.80,73.00
  goto 86.30,78.20
  goto 86.60,78.30
  interact 106318 optional
  note One generic Battered Chest object at six fixed points among the eastern ruins; loot is the usual container fare. No quest takes it.
  note Respawn timer unconfirmed.
